---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="WebUtil privacy policy. All tools run entirely in your browser. We do not collect, store, or transmit any data. Your privacy is our priority."
>
  <div class="container-main py-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-8">Last updated: December 2025</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Our Privacy Promise</h2>
        <p>WebUtil is designed from the ground up to respect your privacy. Every tool on this platform runs entirely in your browser using client-side JavaScript. Your data never leaves your device.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Data Collection</h2>
        <p>We do not collect, store, or process any data you enter into our tools. We do not use cookies for tracking purposes. We do not have user accounts, and we do not log your IP address.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Analytics</h2>
        <p>We use privacy-focused analytics that do not track individual users. We only collect anonymous, aggregated data about page views to understand which tools are most popular and improve our platform.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We may display advertisements via Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to serve relevant ads. You can manage your ad preferences through Google's ad settings. We do not share any user data with advertisers.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Data Security</h2>
        <p>Since all data processing happens client-side, your data never traverses the network. This eliminates the risk of data interception, unauthorized server access, or data breaches on our end.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to use our tools without being tracked. You can use any browser with JavaScript disabled (though our tools require JavaScript to function). If you have privacy concerns, please contact us.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact us</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
